  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Administracin Tributaria</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Tax Administration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo principal del proyecto es fortalecer la administracin tributaria para aumentar la recaudacin de ingresos tributarios, a travs de los siguientes objetivos especficos: (i) aumentar la efectividad del gobierno para recaudar impuestos, a travs de la mejora en la gobernanza de la administracin tributaria; (ii) aumentar la eficiencia de la administracin tributaria, mediante la mejora de los procesos operacionales; (iii) reducir el costo de cumplimiento de los contribuyentes, a travs de la modernizacin de la infraestructura tecnolgica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to strengthen tax administration to increase tax revenue collection, through the following specific objectives: (i) to increase the effectiveness of the government to collect taxes, through improvement in the tax administration governance; (ii) to increase the tax administration efficiency, through the improvement of operational processes; (iii) to reduce taxpayer compliance cost, through the modernization of technological infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
